H('412.d.1',3,"An engineer notices that a supplier substituted a weaker alloy in a safety-critical part. The ethical response is to:","report the substitution and stop use of the part",["ignore it to save time","keep it secret","use it anyway"],"Engineers hold public safety paramount.")
H('412.d.1',4,"Using another company's confidential design files without permission violates professional ethics because it breaks rules of:","intellectual property and confidentiality",["fashion","punctuation","scheduling only"],"Engineers must respect others' proprietary work.")
H('412.d.2.A',3,"A team that works through problem definition, research, ideas, prototype, test, and redesign is following an:","engineering design process",["accounting cycle","grading scale","payroll plan"],"A process gives structure to design work.")
